Z||000004||fix||11-15-2001||09:55 PM||||this topic was just covered not long ago.  There is a company called Phantom Grip (http://www.phantomgrip.com) that makes a limited slip unit for the isuzu 5 speed and I'm fairly sure the Getrag 5 speed as well.  Not sure on the 4 speeds.  Rumor has it you can also get these differentials at Mantaray Motorsports Racing (http://www.mmrusa.com) for about $290 or so.  That would be the best place to start looking.  ||||reg||1
